      "url": "https://mfa.gov.tr/the-guidelines-agreed-between-president-denktas-and-the-late-archbishop-makarios-on-12-february-1977.en.mfa",
      "usedFor": "The four guidelines: an independent, non-aligned, bi-communal federal republic, with a central government whose powers safeguard unity having regard to the bi-communal character; the settlement that Cypriotism adopts as its goal."
    },
    {
