    {
      "text": "The communities of a country should not be tied to guarantor or kin states that can intervene on their behalf.",
      "value": 2,
      "rationale": "The agreed framework guarantees independence against union with any other country, and AKEL calls the system of guarantees unnecessary and anachronistic.",
      "sources": [
